{
 "total": 41.872,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.347,
   "texto": "That rock from the river can blow up in your fire pit!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.497,
   "b": 4.614,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo says I'm making it up!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 4.734,
   "b": 7.515,
   "texto": "Rocks don't explode! They're rocks! That's a myth!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 7.635,
   "b": 11.154,
   "texto": "River rocks sat in water for years. Some of it is still trapped inside.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 11.274,
   "b": 13.394,
   "texto": "Light a fire, and that water turns to steam.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 13.494,
   "b": 17.511,
   "texto": "The steam has nowhere to go, so the rock cracks. Sometimes, it pops!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 17.661,
   "b": 21.196,
   "texto": "Okay, but mine are totally dry. I picked them up last summer.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 21.316,
   "b": 24.392,
   "texto": "Dry on the outside. And every rain soaks them up again.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 24.512,
   "b": 26.659,
   "texto": "So what am I supposed to use? Nothing?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 26.759,
   "b": 29.793,
   "texto": "Fire brick inside the ring. Or dense stone made for fire pits.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 29.913,
   "b": 32.635,
   "texto": "Keep river rock out of the flames, and away from the ring.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 32.785,
   "b": 35.234,
   "texto": "Fine. But I'm keeping the cute ones for the garden.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 35.434,
   "b": 39.556,
   "texto": "River rocks in a fire pit. Myth, or real danger? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 39.756,
   "b": 41.872,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
